* Install PowerShell for MacOS

https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/scripting/install/installing-powershell-on-macos?view=powershell-7.5

brew install --cask powershell

* Or upgrade

brew update
brew outdated
brew upgrade

* Run PowerShell

pwsh

* Install the Teams module

Install-Module -Name MicrosoftTeams -Force

* Connect to Microsoft Teams

Connect-MicrosoftTeams
(authenticate in the browser)

* Get the Group ID of the Team

$teamName = "Комп'ютерні мережі ПМ-2026"
$group = Get-Team | Where-Object { $_.DisplayName -eq $teamName }
$groupId = $group.GroupId

* Add members to Team

$members = Get-Content "./student_emails"

foreach ($member in $members) {
    Add-TeamUser -GroupId $groupId -User $member
}

Note: student_emails is a list of emails, one per line:
user1@domain.com
user2@domain.com
user3@domain.com


